The Guugu Yimidhirr word "dhigul" was first written as "Je-Quoll". I'm 
thinking of borrowing it into Lojban "djekuole", but I'm not sure how the 
Yimidhirr word is pronounced, or if I should hold to the Yimidhirr vowels 
(Guugu Yimidhirr has "i a u", which can be short or long, but not "e o").

